name ifis-macros
category Package
revision 75195
shortdesc Check if a given input string is a number or dimension for TeX
longdesc This package provides three macros: \ifisint, \ifisdim, and
longdesc \ifisglue. They test if a given input string represents either
longdesc a valid integer or a valid dimension or a valid (mu)glue
longdesc specification for TeX.
